WEBVTT

01:34.640 --> 01:37.830
[Bloom Life]

01:38.580 --> 01:42.470
[2016]

01:44.539 --> 01:45.900
I envy you so much.

01:45.930 --> 01:47.680
You are leaving here soon.

01:48.700 --> 01:51.039
I'm just going to Shanghai for college.

01:51.039 --> 01:52.759
It's not like I'm never coming back.

01:52.759 --> 01:53.390
No.

01:53.840 --> 01:56.259
You need to travel further
and see more of the world.

01:56.259 --> 01:58.789
You're the best student
among the three of us.

01:59.680 --> 02:01.230
You need to study hard,

02:01.260 --> 02:02.870
find a good job,

02:02.950 --> 02:05.040
date the boy you like,

02:05.040 --> 02:07.100
and wear the clothes you want to wear.

02:07.770 --> 02:09.410
You should live a brilliant life,

02:09.410 --> 02:10.539
twice as brilliant,

02:10.650 --> 02:12.110
three times as brilliant.

02:12.730 --> 02:14.850
Your eyes are our eyes.

02:15.960 --> 02:18.079
You need to see the world for us,

02:18.190 --> 02:19.000
okay?

02:35.380 --> 02:38.970
[Episode 8: I Spent a Long Vacation Here]

02:41.030 --> 02:41.800
Minawar.

02:46.340 --> 02:47.910
I've been so tied up lately.

02:48.650 --> 02:51.450
I couldn't make it
to your wedding and childbirth.

02:52.500 --> 02:53.530
This is my gift.

02:55.220 --> 02:56.500
I'll get going.

03:09.730 --> 03:10.430
Thank you.

03:26.870 --> 03:27.650
Who is he?

03:29.120 --> 03:31.579
An old friend
who has just come back from abroad.

03:31.579 --> 03:32.320
Abroad?

03:37.620 --> 03:39.530
It seems there's a new dance audition

03:39.530 --> 03:41.079
in the troupe recently.
I want to give it a try.

03:41.079 --> 03:42.160
Audition?

03:42.500 --> 03:44.390
You're a mother now,
and you still want to audition?

03:44.390 --> 03:46.520
What are you thinking about every day?

03:46.960 --> 03:48.290
I'm asking you who he is.

03:49.410 --> 03:50.150
I told you, he's my—

03:50.150 --> 03:51.190
Don't yell!

03:56.350 --> 03:57.680
It's fruiting!

03:59.210 --> 04:01.630
It's bearing fruit just
in time for the opening tomorrow.

04:01.630 --> 04:04.280
It definitely means it will
be a huge success.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.860
You just put it here.

04:09.860 --> 04:11.090
Hey, no, no, no.

04:11.090 --> 04:12.910
It looks so good.

04:12.910 --> 04:14.080
So pretty.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.020
I didn't fire this well.

04:15.020 --> 04:16.560
It's still matte.

04:16.560 --> 04:18.060
I need to apply another layer
of transparent glaze

04:18.060 --> 04:18.680
and re-fire it.

04:18.680 --> 04:19.829
Looks fine to me.

04:19.829 --> 04:21.230
I think it's pretty good.

04:26.060 --> 04:27.660
Arzugul, what are you doing?

04:28.230 --> 04:29.880
I want to call Minawar

04:30.100 --> 04:31.960
and ask her to come over and dance.

04:33.250 --> 04:35.420
Dance at the opening ceremony?

04:37.830 --> 04:38.890
I don't think I can.

04:39.220 --> 04:41.800
I haven't danced for months.

04:42.290 --> 04:43.930
I'm afraid I'll make a fool of myself.

04:43.930 --> 04:45.800
Why can't you?

04:46.100 --> 04:48.020
Isn't dancing
what you're most familiar with?

04:48.020 --> 04:49.510
Doing what you know best

04:49.540 --> 04:51.040
in the place you know best,
why can't you?

04:51.040 --> 04:52.659
Exactly. Just come over.

04:52.659 --> 04:53.300
We're all here.

04:53.300 --> 04:54.190
You must come tomorrow.

04:54.190 --> 04:54.990
It's settled.

05:38.440 --> 05:39.760
What are you doing in there?

05:39.760 --> 05:41.220
The baby is crying so hard.

05:41.420 --> 05:42.680
Come out and nurse her.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.630
This is where the old kitchen was.

06:12.630 --> 06:13.600
It's also become a guest room now.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.950
I've redesigned the whole space.

06:15.950 --> 06:17.370
Each guest room has its own theme.

06:17.370 --> 06:19.840
This one here
is our music-themed room.

06:20.180 --> 06:21.130
That one is our food-theme room.

06:21.130 --> 06:22.370
Great guy.

06:22.370 --> 06:23.870
Smart girl.

06:29.800 --> 06:30.600
Dad,

06:30.670 --> 06:32.190
I didn't fire this jar well.

06:32.190 --> 06:34.420
I originally used a darker blue,

06:34.520 --> 06:35.540
but I don't know why

06:35.540 --> 06:37.540
it turned out lighter after firing.

06:37.560 --> 06:39.220
Not knowing what color

06:39.220 --> 06:40.250
it will turn out

06:41.770 --> 06:44.030
is what makes earthenware interesting.

06:45.260 --> 06:46.720
This is your masterpiece.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.970
From now on, just follow your own ideas

06:51.500 --> 06:52.840
to make earthenware.

06:54.000 --> 06:55.320
[The Symbiosis of All Things:
Laili Batur]

06:55.490 --> 06:58.900
1, 2, 3!

06:59.000 --> 07:00.040
[Soaring Dove Homestay]

07:05.450 --> 07:06.940
Congratulations.

07:06.960 --> 07:08.840
This is the tapestry
I brought back for you.

07:08.840 --> 07:10.490
Thank you. It's beautiful.

07:10.920 --> 07:11.570
Where should we hang it?

07:11.570 --> 07:11.950
Hang it on the first floor.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.450
The first floor.

07:12.450 --> 07:12.830
Okay.

07:13.170 --> 07:14.700
Why isn't Minawar here yet?

07:14.700 --> 07:15.800
Sorry, I'm late.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.300
Here she is.

07:18.390 --> 07:19.720
We were just waiting for you.

07:19.720 --> 07:22.020
We're waiting for you to dance the finale.

07:22.020 --> 07:24.160
I don't really know how to dance anymore.

07:24.160 --> 07:25.690
I haven't danced in so long.

07:26.130 --> 07:26.890
I'd rather not embarrass myself.

07:26.890 --> 07:28.510
How come you can't dance?

07:28.510 --> 07:29.930
You're so good at it.

07:30.770 --> 07:31.360
Let's have a drink.

07:31.360 --> 07:32.950
Cheers.

07:36.050 --> 07:37.220
It's delicious.

07:39.120 --> 07:40.940
I've been meaning to tell you.

07:41.110 --> 07:43.630
Thank you for the costume
you gave me last time.

07:43.630 --> 07:45.250
Even though I

07:45.280 --> 07:47.210
might never be able to dance again,

07:47.680 --> 07:50.680
seeing that costume

07:51.120 --> 07:53.060
made me see my old self.

07:53.060 --> 07:54.370
What do you mean you won't dance?

07:54.370 --> 07:56.659
You were and still are the most beautiful.

07:56.659 --> 07:58.190
Who was it that determined,
since childhood,

07:58.190 --> 08:00.630
to dance at the foot of Muztagh Ata?

08:01.000 --> 08:01.660
Then everyone,

08:01.660 --> 08:04.470
how about we go see the golden sunrise
on the mountain together?

08:04.470 --> 08:05.150
Sure.

08:09.060 --> 08:10.860
I think you are born for dancing.

08:11.600 --> 08:13.800
I believe you also want to keep dancing.

08:15.710 --> 08:16.210
Cheers.

08:35.320 --> 08:36.460
Hello, boss. Check out.

08:36.460 --> 08:37.340
Okay.

08:37.600 --> 08:38.150
Xia Zi.

08:38.360 --> 08:39.049
Which room?

08:39.450 --> 08:40.940
The earthenware room inside.

08:40.940 --> 08:41.630
Follow me.

08:41.650 --> 08:42.809
Hope you enjoyed your stay.

08:42.809 --> 08:44.169
This room is pretty good.

08:44.169 --> 08:44.990
Yes, the environment is great.

08:44.990 --> 08:46.200
All right, it's all done.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.410
Please help us promote it.

08:47.410 --> 08:47.870
Definitely.

08:47.870 --> 08:48.390
Thank you.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.390
Have a good time.

08:49.880 --> 08:51.140
Your car is at the door.

08:51.250 --> 08:52.180
Okay, thank you.

09:00.580 --> 09:01.850
This mung bean pillow

09:02.330 --> 09:03.780
is best for the baby.

09:03.800 --> 09:06.200
It keeps the baby's head
from getting flat.

09:08.530 --> 09:09.730
When you were little,

09:10.080 --> 09:11.940
you weren't as obedient as Aliya.

09:12.930 --> 09:15.020
Whenever I put you in the cradle,

09:15.260 --> 09:16.860
you would cry and make a fuss.

09:17.410 --> 09:19.910
You had to hold my arm to sleep.

09:24.050 --> 09:26.130
I've read the National Arts Fund project

09:26.130 --> 09:27.960
you showed me

09:28.880 --> 09:29.790
last time.

09:32.270 --> 09:33.510
This project is specifically

09:33.510 --> 09:35.220
for dance talents in Xinjiang.

09:35.220 --> 09:37.050
The teachers are all dancers.

09:37.150 --> 09:38.860
This opportunity is too good for you.

09:38.860 --> 09:41.320
It's tailor-made
for a star dancer like you.

09:42.010 --> 09:44.100
I'm not a star dancer anymore.

09:44.470 --> 09:46.520
The current star is Gulistan.

09:46.550 --> 09:47.480
Nonsense.

09:56.510 --> 09:57.600
Actually.

09:58.650 --> 09:59.860
I came here this time

10:00.940 --> 10:02.100
to ask you to help me

10:02.100 --> 10:03.770
take care of Aliya for a while.

10:05.430 --> 10:06.830
You've made up your mind?

10:08.040 --> 10:10.230
As long as it's something
you truly want to do,

10:10.230 --> 10:11.490
just go ahead and do it.

10:11.860 --> 10:13.310
No matter where you go,

10:14.150 --> 10:15.770
I'll always support you.

10:16.360 --> 10:18.490
We've got things covered here at home.

10:26.100 --> 10:27.120
No matter

10:27.900 --> 10:29.330
where that person goes,

10:30.500 --> 10:31.740
they are looking

10:32.620 --> 10:33.880
at the same moon as you.

10:39.990 --> 10:40.920
Laili,

10:41.710 --> 10:43.770
I want to discuss something with you.

10:43.860 --> 10:44.650
Go ahead.

10:46.270 --> 10:47.270
This money

10:49.550 --> 10:52.480
is from your part-time job
over the past six months.

10:52.940 --> 10:53.700
Dad.

10:55.590 --> 10:57.090
I saved it all for you.

10:58.020 --> 10:59.060
Take it back.

11:04.070 --> 11:04.830
Take it.

11:07.660 --> 11:08.830
This workshop

11:09.200 --> 11:10.660
will be handed over to you.

11:13.940 --> 11:16.680
I believe you can make better earthenware.

11:17.890 --> 11:18.840
Dad.

11:19.620 --> 11:20.650
Take the money,

11:21.220 --> 11:22.240
go out,

11:24.440 --> 11:25.700
and see the world.

11:27.360 --> 11:28.480
And also see

11:29.440 --> 11:30.370
how other people

11:30.940 --> 11:32.710
make earthenware.

11:43.260 --> 11:44.350
Mom, Dad.

11:44.380 --> 11:45.770
Why are you back so late again?

11:45.770 --> 11:48.030
Come here. I have something to say to you.

12:03.240 --> 12:04.300
Are you kidding me?

12:04.430 --> 12:06.780
The kid is so young, and you want to stay
in Shanghai for half a year?

12:06.780 --> 12:08.220
What kind of mother does that?

12:08.220 --> 12:10.340
I provide you with a good life
in this big house,

12:10.340 --> 12:12.040
yet all you want to do
is expose yourself in public.

12:12.040 --> 12:13.620
Who knows what man you were out meeting

12:13.620 --> 12:15.220
coming home so late at night?

12:15.280 --> 12:17.570
I am your wife, not your caged bird.

12:17.770 --> 12:19.320
I'll lay it on the line today.

12:19.320 --> 12:21.450
If you want to leave, I'll divorce you!

12:27.160 --> 12:28.160
Stop right there.

12:32.450 --> 12:33.710
What does she mean?

12:43.820 --> 12:45.200
What are you doing?

12:45.400 --> 12:48.530
Go ahead without worry.
I'll take care of things at home.

12:48.910 --> 12:51.950
Do you remember when Arzugul
left for Shanghai

12:52.280 --> 12:54.610
and we said goodbye at the alley entrance?

12:54.930 --> 12:56.080
You told me,

12:56.100 --> 12:58.100
"It's best if you never come back."

13:00.730 --> 13:01.810
It's amazing.

13:02.160 --> 13:05.410
The one who said
she would leave has stayed.

13:05.820 --> 13:08.200
And the ones who stayed are leaving now.

13:09.200 --> 13:11.060
But we will definitely come back.

13:11.540 --> 13:13.400
I'll wait for you two to come back.

13:24.650 --> 13:26.010
Alright.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.120
Go.

13:27.720 --> 13:28.480
Go.

14:11.940 --> 14:14.290
[Kashgar City—Shache County]

14:58.670 --> 15:02.430
♪ Are these four lonely walls ♪

15:03.700 --> 15:07.780
♪ The sound of the dutar ♪

15:08.510 --> 15:11.530
♪ made my heart broken ♪

15:13.360 --> 15:16.520
♪ An empty bowl is enough ♪

15:17.980 --> 15:19.700
Parhat went to Urumqi

15:19.700 --> 15:20.960
to study modern music.

15:21.360 --> 15:23.020
I don't know when he'll be back.

15:23.020 --> 15:24.820
He left this instrument behind.

15:25.510 --> 15:26.220
Thank you.

15:50.890 --> 15:51.740
Xia Zi,

15:52.420 --> 15:54.120
I go to the Kizil Caves early

15:54.440 --> 15:57.270
every morning
to make copies of the murals.

15:57.920 --> 16:01.740
[Kizil Caves, Cave 38 (Replica)]

15:58.230 --> 15:59.560
Time passes very slowly

15:59.890 --> 16:01.980
while working here.

16:02.890 --> 16:04.780
Every mural here

16:05.420 --> 16:07.390
hides an ancient legend.

16:11.540 --> 16:13.870
A painting I have been working on recently

16:14.360 --> 16:15.930
has a moving story.

16:17.420 --> 16:19.360
Deep in the distant desert,

16:19.890 --> 16:21.690
a merchant caravan lost its way.

16:22.440 --> 16:24.750
They plunged into a bottomless darkness

16:25.240 --> 16:26.900
and were on the verge of death.

16:27.260 --> 16:30.550
Amidst fear, hunger, and despair,

16:31.210 --> 16:34.140
Sa Bo, the merchant leader,
was moved by compassion.

16:34.360 --> 16:37.120
He set himself on fire to light the way,

16:37.620 --> 16:39.740
tearing through the eternal night.

16:40.770 --> 16:41.980
In the faint light ignited

16:41.980 --> 16:45.050
by Sa Bo's fire of life,

16:45.450 --> 16:48.450
the caravan
escaped the predicament and survived.

16:51.510 --> 16:53.130
When I was painting it,

16:54.820 --> 16:56.580
I kept thinking of your dad.

16:58.250 --> 16:59.900
He also left a light

17:00.880 --> 17:02.360
in our hearts.

17:12.900 --> 17:13.589
By the way,

17:14.640 --> 17:15.750
I have something

17:16.290 --> 17:17.020
to give you.

17:17.910 --> 17:20.470
What is it? So mysterious.

17:27.680 --> 17:28.880
My dad's phone?

17:31.160 --> 17:32.200
Why do you have it?

17:32.550 --> 17:33.680
Your mom gave it to me

17:33.770 --> 17:34.970
and asked me to fix it.

17:36.060 --> 17:38.390
I took it with me
when I went home last time,

17:38.460 --> 17:40.920
and they just mailed it back
after fixing it.

17:45.550 --> 17:46.270
Zi,

17:47.200 --> 17:48.810
I just finished a surgery.

17:50.740 --> 17:51.310
A war has

17:52.270 --> 17:53.070
started here.

17:53.610 --> 17:55.670
The hospital got busy all of a sudden.

17:55.900 --> 17:57.230
The more it's like this,

17:59.420 --> 18:01.180
the more I miss you and your mom.

18:19.360 --> 18:21.230
The situation here is very bad.

18:22.940 --> 18:24.090
I'm not sure

18:28.740 --> 18:29.780
if I'll be able

18:32.550 --> 18:34.080
to go back and see you again.

18:39.350 --> 18:40.480
I'm not even sure

18:42.060 --> 18:44.040
if you'll ever see this video.

18:58.900 --> 18:59.770
I've decided.

19:01.750 --> 19:02.950
Record a video for me.

19:09.460 --> 19:10.310
Ready?

19:18.930 --> 19:20.970
I saw the video you recorded for me,

19:22.560 --> 19:23.890
even though it was late.

19:31.110 --> 19:31.850
Dad,

19:35.550 --> 19:36.740
I miss you, too.

19:40.660 --> 19:41.350
That day,

19:43.050 --> 19:45.710
everyone was saying goodbye
to you at the store.

19:45.940 --> 19:46.810
Everyone talked about

19:46.810 --> 19:48.660
the last thing you said to them.

19:50.680 --> 19:51.740
But I didn't say it.

19:54.160 --> 19:55.440
Because at that time,

19:56.250 --> 19:58.710
I wasn't ready
to say goodbye to you at all.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.110
No matter what,

20:05.220 --> 20:06.610
I want to tell you

20:08.660 --> 20:10.520
that you've always been my pride.

20:11.300 --> 20:13.200
You've been independent and warm-hearted

20:13.200 --> 20:14.460
since you were little.

20:14.570 --> 20:15.700
That's just like me.

20:17.310 --> 20:18.640
You have your own ideas,

20:18.770 --> 20:19.970
and you're stubborn.

20:20.010 --> 20:21.740
That's just like your mom.

20:23.050 --> 20:24.580
But with your personality,

20:25.270 --> 20:26.330
I'm always worried

20:27.190 --> 20:28.040
you'll

20:28.060 --> 20:29.560
take a wrong turn.

20:30.770 --> 20:32.370
But thinking about it now...

20:32.610 --> 20:33.670
Actually, it's not

20:33.860 --> 20:35.720
a bad thing
for you to be like this.

20:36.350 --> 20:37.700
No matter when,

20:39.020 --> 20:40.050
just be yourself.

20:45.080 --> 20:46.210
You are my daughter,

20:47.080 --> 20:49.340
but more importantly, you are yourself.

20:49.900 --> 20:52.430
You don't need
to be like everyone else at all.

20:54.040 --> 20:54.780
I know.

20:55.900 --> 20:58.400
You always wanted me to have a stable

20:59.660 --> 21:00.700
and smooth life.

21:01.460 --> 21:02.790
I have been trying hard.

21:03.240 --> 21:05.400
I wanted to be that piece of the puzzle.

21:06.850 --> 21:08.980
But I was losing control more and more.

21:09.160 --> 21:11.050
I couldn't control my time

21:11.430 --> 21:13.300
or my life.

21:14.550 --> 21:17.010
to the point
where I'd forgotten my own name.

21:18.420 --> 21:19.550
My name is Xia Zi.

21:21.440 --> 21:23.090
I am your and Mom's daughter.

21:25.760 --> 21:27.420
I have the backing you gave me.

21:27.640 --> 21:28.640
So I'm not afraid.

21:29.350 --> 21:30.550
I'm not afraid to fail

21:30.900 --> 21:31.770
or start over.

21:33.110 --> 21:35.400
I can live the life I like.

21:36.230 --> 21:37.230
I can go find

21:37.850 --> 21:39.530
where I truly belong,

21:40.350 --> 21:42.200
though I haven't found it yet.

21:44.610 --> 21:45.270
Zi.

21:46.010 --> 21:47.070
You must remember,

21:50.700 --> 21:51.660
Dad loves you.

21:54.360 --> 21:55.120
Dad

21:55.850 --> 21:57.050
will always love you.

22:02.980 --> 22:03.850
Dad.

22:05.820 --> 22:07.210
I also want to tell you

22:11.590 --> 22:12.720
that I love you, too.

22:51.540 --> 22:52.780
Enjoy your stay.

22:52.080 --> 22:53.460
[Soaring Dove Homestay]

22:53.580 --> 22:54.820
Xia Zi, look.

22:55.290 --> 22:57.350
Our account has gone viral recently.

22:58.000 --> 22:59.330
So many likes?

22:59.750 --> 23:00.380
No wonder

23:00.380 --> 23:02.440
two more booking orders just came in.

23:05.270 --> 23:06.160
I just got back.

23:06.190 --> 23:07.520
Why did you call me here?

23:07.750 --> 23:10.080
I still have a bunch
of deliveries to make.

23:12.000 --> 23:13.920
The cleaning lady had something come up

23:13.920 --> 23:15.000
and can't make it today.

23:15.000 --> 23:16.290
It's just one room upstairs—

23:16.290 --> 23:17.250
the "Cinematic Memories" room.

23:17.250 --> 23:18.580
Can you help me clean it?

23:27.070 --> 23:31.620
♪ We are separated ♪

23:33.900 --> 23:39.070
♪ Drifting in and out of the crowds ♪

23:40.330 --> 23:46.440
♪ Confining dusk within the dawn ♪

23:47.650 --> 23:53.140
♪ Waiting aimlessly
for the traffic lights ♪

23:54.560 --> 23:59.810
♪ Suddenly, I never ask again ♪

24:01.120 --> 24:06.650
♪ About the lingering warmth upon waking ♪

24:08.200 --> 24:14.350
♪ This unexpected sincerity ♪

24:14.620 --> 24:19.830
♪ Makes each of our lives complete ♪

24:21.480 --> 24:28.200
♪ I can't quite describe it ♪

24:28.580 --> 24:31.770
♪ A sudden, unexpected surprise ♪

24:31.970 --> 24:34.950
♪ Don't go away too fast ♪

24:34.980 --> 24:41.690
♪ It truly exists ♪

24:42.040 --> 24:45.660
♪ Thank you for your generosity ♪

24:45.680 --> 24:50.390
♪ For making me believe in love ♪

25:04.140 --> 25:05.220
You put it on?

25:15.430 --> 25:19.120
Our house hasn't been this lively
in a long time.

25:22.030 --> 25:22.880
Grandma.

25:23.530 --> 25:24.380
Grandma.

25:25.090 --> 25:25.750
Uncle,

25:26.180 --> 25:26.790
Auntie,

25:28.500 --> 25:31.500
I would like to ask
for your permission to marry Laili.

25:33.070 --> 25:34.530
He's proposing to her.

25:35.220 --> 25:37.220
I will definitely make Laili happy.

25:38.180 --> 25:39.650
I am sincere.

25:40.300 --> 25:41.380
Please believe me.

25:44.790 --> 25:46.290
No.

25:46.290 --> 25:47.750
You can't agree so easily.

25:47.790 --> 25:48.380
Arzugul.

25:48.380 --> 25:49.580
Whose side are you on?

25:49.880 --> 25:50.720
No, no.

25:51.540 --> 25:53.830
I will definitely
ask my grandpa and parents

25:53.830 --> 25:55.490
to come and propose in person.

25:55.590 --> 25:56.460
Right.

25:56.460 --> 25:57.920
That's more like it.

25:57.920 --> 25:59.250
Congratulations, young man.

25:59.250 --> 26:00.180
Congratulations.

26:00.180 --> 26:01.330
Laili, congratulations.

26:01.330 --> 26:02.950
Congratulations.

26:02.980 --> 26:07.290
If only Minawar were here.

26:07.500 --> 26:09.680
Come, have a baked bun.

26:14.170 --> 26:14.920
Grandma!

26:15.150 --> 26:16.240
Grandma!

26:16.340 --> 26:17.410
Grandma!

26:18.460 --> 26:20.420
Mom, what's wrong?

26:20.790 --> 26:22.590
Hurry, take her to the hospital.

26:38.120 --> 26:39.190
Minawar?

26:40.700 --> 26:42.140
Grandma.

26:44.710 --> 26:46.160
You're here, my granddaughter.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.440
She cut her hair.

26:47.440 --> 26:48.800
You scared me to death.

26:49.440 --> 26:50.480
It's okay.

26:50.480 --> 26:53.090
It seems I can live a few more days.

26:53.090 --> 26:54.640
Don't say that.

26:54.670 --> 26:55.780
Don't say that.

26:57.110 --> 26:59.500
Auntie, get some good rest. It's fine.

26:59.680 --> 27:00.700
Children.

27:01.870 --> 27:03.660
I know

27:04.510 --> 27:05.970
my own body.

27:07.380 --> 27:10.380
I have something to tell you.

27:11.500 --> 27:12.290
Minawar.

27:12.880 --> 27:16.970
I haven't seen
the snow mountains for many years.

27:23.780 --> 27:25.930
My lovely pigeon.

27:26.090 --> 27:27.330
Thank you

27:27.980 --> 27:32.470
for coming with me
to see the snow mountains.

27:34.540 --> 27:35.970
All my life,

27:36.910 --> 27:38.720
I've been my husband's wife,

27:39.050 --> 27:40.660
my children's mother,

27:41.370 --> 27:44.830
and your grandmother.

27:46.490 --> 27:49.650
I feel very happy.

27:51.610 --> 27:52.900
But

27:53.290 --> 27:56.330
my only regret is

27:57.140 --> 27:59.830
that I've spent my whole life living here

28:00.300 --> 28:03.060
and never left.

28:03.750 --> 28:05.220
So in my next life,

28:06.290 --> 28:09.680
I want to be a pigeon,

28:11.510 --> 28:15.900
soaring and gliding through the blue sky

28:17.040 --> 28:18.960
to see the world.

28:19.420 --> 28:21.870
That would be great.

28:23.550 --> 28:28.610
You will, Grandma.

28:31.200 --> 28:36.380
♪ We have crossed countless perils ♪

28:36.410 --> 28:42.260
♪ We have scaled high mountains ♪

28:42.800 --> 28:47.820
♪ Opening our arms to those
in the wind and rain ♪

28:47.850 --> 28:53.260
♪ When liberation comes ♪

28:53.960 --> 28:59.010
♪ Sunlight will shine across the land ♪

28:59.030 --> 29:05.470
♪ The thick mist has already dispersed ♪

29:05.850 --> 29:10.920
♪ Opening our arms to those
in the wind and rain ♪

29:10.950 --> 29:16.470
♪ When liberation comes ♪

29:18.020 --> 29:23.590
♪ It is our sacred duty ♪

29:23.610 --> 29:29.970
♪ When liberation comes ♪

29:47.480 --> 29:48.330
Laili.

29:50.350 --> 29:50.930
How is it?

29:51.590 --> 29:53.420
Does it feel familiar?

29:53.990 --> 29:55.230
I didn't expect

29:55.790 --> 29:57.850
you to decorate this place like this.

29:58.530 --> 29:59.370
Do you like it?

29:59.400 --> 30:00.510
I really love it.

30:01.900 --> 30:03.970
Scoop out a big round piece,

30:03.990 --> 30:05.850
just like we did when we were kids.

30:06.990 --> 30:07.690
I thought

30:08.810 --> 30:10.590
that after this place was renovated,

30:10.590 --> 30:12.050
our secret base from childhood

30:12.050 --> 30:12.930
would no longer exist.

30:12.930 --> 30:13.580
How could that be?

30:13.580 --> 30:14.950
Exactly, how could that be?

30:14.950 --> 30:17.190
Guess which girl I saw Sadiq with

30:17.210 --> 30:19.310
at the cinema last week?

30:19.530 --> 30:21.120
What's there to guess?

30:21.150 --> 30:22.310
It was Gulistan.

30:22.340 --> 30:23.580
How do you know?

30:24.740 --> 30:26.390
He's single now.

30:26.550 --> 30:28.880
He can watch movies with whoever he wants.

30:29.420 --> 30:30.600
You are so open-minded.

30:30.600 --> 30:31.140
Yeah.

30:32.850 --> 30:33.740
Actually,

30:34.020 --> 30:35.880
I thought about it for a long time.

30:36.140 --> 30:37.850
It was not that he didn't love me.

30:37.850 --> 30:38.640
It was just

30:38.640 --> 30:40.850
that the way he loved me
wasn't what I wanted.

30:40.850 --> 30:42.240
Then before...

30:42.440 --> 30:45.240
It was my own choice
to marry someone I didn't love.

30:46.040 --> 30:48.770
But you had the courage
to bear everything after,

30:49.100 --> 30:49.800
right?

30:53.560 --> 30:55.890
Arzugul, what about you and Zhou Hengzhi?

31:03.590 --> 31:05.480
A homestay in Zhejiang

31:05.480 --> 31:07.080
saw how I renovated our place

31:07.170 --> 31:08.370
and reached out to me.

31:08.770 --> 31:09.980
That's a good thing.

31:12.990 --> 31:13.880
Then...

31:14.850 --> 31:16.720
Are you leaving again?

31:18.310 --> 31:20.310
Honestly, my time back here

31:21.180 --> 31:22.760
has been like a robot vacuum

31:23.170 --> 31:25.100
returning to its docking station:

31:25.470 --> 31:26.690
emptying the trash

31:26.800 --> 31:28.460
and getting fully recharged.

31:28.640 --> 31:30.010
I can set off again.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.870
Does Zhou Hengzhi know?

31:38.680 --> 31:39.900
Whether he supports you or not,

31:39.900 --> 31:41.140
we definitely support you.

31:41.140 --> 31:42.400
Support you forever.

31:43.380 --> 31:44.380
You're my backup.

31:47.320 --> 31:48.770
No one is allowed to run away.

31:48.770 --> 31:49.710
You have to be here,

31:49.710 --> 31:51.240
and you have to be here, too.

31:54.350 --> 31:56.750
Hey Minawar,
I really want to see you dance.

31:56.850 --> 31:57.980
I want to see it, too.

31:59.380 --> 32:00.180
Are you ready?

32:00.870 --> 32:02.180
Okay, let's start.

32:03.770 --> 32:05.530
3, 2, 1.

33:14.650 --> 33:15.810
You startled me.

33:16.120 --> 33:17.370
That was the point.

33:18.500 --> 33:21.200
What are you doing here?

33:22.620 --> 33:23.140
Don't you go surprising me

33:23.140 --> 33:25.540
by pulling a ring out of thin air
in a moment.

33:29.680 --> 33:30.310
Are...

33:30.340 --> 33:31.670
Are you really going to?

33:31.710 --> 33:32.630
Xia Zi,

33:35.600 --> 33:37.030
I don't have a ring for you.

33:37.030 --> 33:38.290
You scared me to death.

33:38.300 --> 33:39.320
But

33:39.480 --> 33:41.020
I have a gift for you.

33:41.580 --> 33:42.340
Check it out.

33:53.380 --> 33:54.600
I know you want to go.

33:55.930 --> 33:58.170
It will be a bigger stage.

33:59.280 --> 34:00.280
You can

34:00.640 --> 34:02.170
unleash your talent there.

34:02.240 --> 34:03.630
And this place and I

34:04.870 --> 34:06.270
shouldn't hold you back.

34:10.460 --> 34:12.340
It's not that urgent.

34:13.310 --> 34:16.270
I'll go after everything is settled here.

34:17.420 --> 34:18.960
Who are you looking down on?

34:18.980 --> 34:21.719
I'm the most professional
when it comes to homestays.

34:21.719 --> 34:22.510
Besides,

34:23.719 --> 34:25.550
there are Uncle, Auntie,

34:26.199 --> 34:27.260
and everyone else.

34:30.670 --> 34:32.290
Aren't you worried?

34:34.690 --> 34:36.060
In that case,

34:36.090 --> 34:36.840
don't go.

34:38.370 --> 34:39.780
Your mom told me

34:39.850 --> 34:41.449
the story of her and your Dad.

34:43.080 --> 34:44.500
The land here is so vast.

34:46.100 --> 34:47.560
Love shouldn't be narrow.

34:50.090 --> 34:51.690
I hope you can become better.

34:55.080 --> 34:56.000
I'll be

34:58.400 --> 34:59.600
waiting for you here.

35:03.350 --> 35:04.050
Go.

35:09.150 --> 35:09.940
Thank you.

35:17.080 --> 35:18.820
Think of me when you're out there.

35:18.820 --> 35:21.030
W-When I'm unhappy,

35:22.330 --> 35:24.060
I carve one of these for myself.

35:29.490 --> 35:31.090
Come back if you're unhappy.

35:41.050 --> 35:42.380
You must come back soon.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.420
After all, a man's prime

35:45.440 --> 35:46.770
doesn't last that long.

35:47.660 --> 35:49.910
You are so shameless.

36:24.170 --> 36:28.460
♪ The sun goes down, but tomorrow
it will climb again ♪

36:28.490 --> 36:32.460
♪ Flowers fade, but next year
they will bloom again ♪

36:32.760 --> 36:36.870
♪ The beautiful bird is gone
without a trace ♪

36:36.920 --> 36:41.240
♪ My youth, like that bird,
will never come back again ♪

36:41.270 --> 36:45.710
♪ My youth, like that bird,
will never come back again ♪

36:55.660 --> 36:57.850
♪ Here, I have spent ♪

36:57.880 --> 37:00.310
♪ A long vacation ♪

37:00.340 --> 37:02.030
♪ Here, I have found ♪

37:02.050 --> 37:04.350
♪ The self within my heart ♪

37:04.370 --> 37:08.020
♪ We will always be the best
for one another ♪

37:08.050 --> 37:10.050
♪ Hand in hand, side by side ♪

37:10.070 --> 37:12.600
♪ Witnessing each other's first times ♪

37:13.550 --> 37:14.710
♪ There are some things ♪

37:14.740 --> 37:17.450
♪ That I entrust only to you
in this life ♪

37:17.480 --> 37:21.230
♪ You are the one
who talked with me until dawn ♪

37:21.870 --> 37:25.470
♪ Let all the secrets be buried
in the wind and sand ♪

37:25.510 --> 37:27.550
♪ Those moments of madness and hardship ♪

37:27.580 --> 37:30.300
♪ Were scattered by the wind
and turned into courage ♪

37:30.330 --> 37:32.780
♪ That eternal, quiet peace ♪

37:32.800 --> 37:34.630
♪ Gives me courage ♪

37:34.660 --> 37:36.600
♪ Consistent as ever ♪

37:36.620 --> 37:38.870
♪ Deeply rooted in my heart ♪

37:38.890 --> 37:41.520
♪ On the streets of Kashgar ♪

37:41.540 --> 37:43.400
♪ Holding hands ♪

37:43.420 --> 37:47.270
♪ Setting off just like that,
walking toward forever ♪

37:47.590 --> 37:49.990
♪ The uncertain, the swaying ♪

37:50.020 --> 37:52.020
♪ There is still time ♪

37:52.040 --> 37:55.940
♪ Steadying oneself, within reach ♪

37:56.420 --> 37:58.940
♪ At the entrance of the post house ♪

37:58.970 --> 38:00.660
♪ Holding hands once more ♪

38:00.680 --> 38:05.050
♪ Dear friend,
the pomegranates are fully ripe ♪

38:14.580 --> 38:16.130
♪ Being a wife, being a mother ♪

38:16.160 --> 38:18.680
♪ A woman surrounded by love ♪

38:18.890 --> 38:20.310
♪ I use love to illuminate ♪

38:20.340 --> 38:22.930
♪ Warming my daughters ♪

38:23.220 --> 38:24.200
♪ Daughters ♪

38:24.220 --> 38:27.300
♪ We are the family
who loves you forever ♪

38:27.330 --> 38:31.540
♪ Home will always
keep its doors open for you ♪

38:32.310 --> 38:33.080
But Dad,

38:33.100 --> 38:34.790
a girl's hands can mold clay,

38:34.820 --> 38:36.150
and they can also dance.

38:44.440 --> 38:48.740
♪ Writing love and hope into songs ♪

38:48.770 --> 38:53.150
♪ Letting the whole world
sing along with me ♪

38:53.180 --> 38:57.250
♪ Holding my love for you
in the palms of my hands ♪

38:57.310 --> 39:01.110
♪ I cherish it carefully with you ♪

39:01.870 --> 39:06.030
♪ I treat you with sincere devotion,
always ♪

39:06.240 --> 39:10.270
♪ Without fearing the eyes of others ♪

39:10.610 --> 39:14.580
♪ Looking back at you
after enduring the wind and rain ♪

39:14.620 --> 39:19.060
♪ Love and courage make us shine ♪

39:19.520 --> 39:23.750
♪ La la la, I am here ♪

39:23.900 --> 39:27.550
♪ Spending my youth, I found you ♪

39:28.470 --> 39:32.890
♪ La, la, la, I am here ♪

39:32.920 --> 39:37.300
♪ Writing an eternal melody ♪

39:42.330 --> 39:43.850
On the way to set off again,

39:44.680 --> 39:45.950
I had a dream.

39:47.080 --> 39:50.520
In the dream,
I heard the sound of the Satar again.

39:52.520 --> 39:54.610
♪ The lover I long for ♪

39:54.650 --> 40:07.850
♪ May you live for a thousand years ♪

40:07.880 --> 40:17.730
♪ May your tears hold no sorrow ♪

40:20.030 --> 40:23.790
♪ Since I saw you, my lover ♪

40:23.810 --> 40:31.980
♪ I have fallen into a pit of distress ♪

40:32.010 --> 40:35.480
♪ You set a fire in my heart ♪

40:43.300 --> 40:44.220
In the dream,

40:45.210 --> 40:46.980
just as a poet said,

40:49.300 --> 40:53.110
the people and things
that exist in memory,

40:54.480 --> 40:55.820
the past and the future,

40:56.900 --> 40:58.500
the sound of music and dance,

40:59.350 --> 41:00.810
the streets and houses,

41:02.040 --> 41:03.290
day and night,

41:03.910 --> 41:05.810
and reality and illusion—

41:06.590 --> 41:07.940
they all intermingle,

41:08.550 --> 41:09.880
blended like milk tea.

41:10.690 --> 41:12.620
The milk and tea become inseparable,

41:12.620 --> 41:15.620
leaving a lingering fragrance
that fills the senses.

42:22.430 --> 42:23.680
I once grew weary

42:25.480 --> 42:27.010
and returned to my hometown

42:27.650 --> 42:28.420
for a nap.

42:30.010 --> 42:31.610
I had a vivid, colorful dream

42:34.630 --> 42:36.030
where I laughed out loud,

42:37.170 --> 42:38.230
cried my heart out,

42:40.480 --> 42:41.940
sang at the top of my lungs,

42:42.590 --> 42:43.990
and danced with abandon.

42:46.520 --> 42:47.580
When I woke up,

42:49.040 --> 42:50.500
I set off again,

42:51.510 --> 42:52.550
no longer afraid.

43:02.490 --> 43:07.700
[Dedicated to us, as we set out once more]
